{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-L12-phone-shop-2-01","date":"2026-11-22","lens":"12","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-2","refs":["F-phone-407","F-phone-408","F-phone-423"],"severity":"S4","title":"On an iPhone the gym message, trainer reply and reminder switches would do nothing","what":"Everything that pops up a notice from the gym only works on Android: the push address is never saved, the 15-minute check and the automatic reminders never start, and the notification part is never loaded on any other phone. The Settings switch 'Messages from my gym' is still shown to every phone, so an iPhone member could turn it on, see it on, and never get a single message, trainer reply or plan-ending reminder. Apple rejects apps whose switches do nothing.","expected":"Before the iPhone app ships, gym messages, trainer replies and reminders work on iPhone too, or the switch is hidden there.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/pushToken.ts:32","apps/mobile/src/shop/pushToken.ts:120","apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeAlertsRun.ts:49","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymReminders.ts:70","apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeTaskSync.ts:20","apps/mobile/src/shop/askReplySync.ts:9-11","apps/mobile/src/components/settings/GymSettings.tsx:93-117"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"gym-notices-android-only","who":"iPhone members, once the iPhone app ships","how_often":"every time","fix_line":"Add iPhone notifications for gym messages and reminders, or hide the switch on iPhone","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
